---
source: tests/proxy_golden.rs
description: The same Anthropic tool_use reply converts to the same Responses output and status in stream and non-stream mode.
---
# stream
response.created {"type":"response.created","response":{"id":"[generated-id:1]","object":"response","created_at":"[timestamp]","status":"in_progress","model":"claude","output":[],"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":0,"total_tokens":5,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0}}}}
